# Environment variables for Temporal Knowledge Graph Embedding pipeline
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values (do NOT commit .env)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Semantic Scholar API key (optional but recommended)
# Get a free key at: https://www.semanticscholar.org/product/api
# Raises rate limit from 100 req/5min to 1 req/sec sustained.
# Without this, the pipeline falls back to a slower rate-limited mode.
S2_API_KEY=

# If you run the pipeline from a different directory, set this to the
# absolute path of the project root. Otherwise scripts use relative paths
# derived from their own location (the default).
# PROJECT_ROOT=/path/to/capstone_sep_15
